  "description_short": "American-style diner serving burgers, ribs and milkshakes in a retro roadhouse setting.",
  "description_long": "Moonshine Runners Diner brings a slice of Americana to Sedgefield's village heart. Step into this retro roadhouse where chrome detailing and classic diner vibes set the scene for generous portions of comfort food done right. The menu leans heavily into American classics — think juicy burgers, sticky ribs, loaded fries and thick milkshakes that hit the spot every time.\n\nLocated on Mossie Avenue in the village centre, it's become a local favourite for families and travellers passing through the Garden Route. The relaxed atmosphere works equally well for a quick lunch or a casual dinner with mates. Prices are fair, portions are generous, and the friendly service keeps people coming back. It's the kind of place where you don't need to overthink it — just order what sounds good and enjoy the laid-back diner experience.",
